<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Glaxo said upped by DLJ.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Glaxo said upped by DLJ.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette upgraded Glaxo Wellcome Plc to buy from underperform, according to market sources.</p>
<p>-- ADRs jumped 7/8 to 35-1/2.</p>
</text>
